 "notes": [
  "Requested hiphil gloss \"bolt\" doesn't match its sole citation, 2Chr.28.15 (\"וַיַּנְעִלוּם\", \"and shod them\", of clothing the captives), which instead is the causative of qal's OTHER sense (\"furnish with sandals\", e.g. Ezek.16.10). \"Bolt\" itself is attested only in qal (2Sam.13.17/18, Judg.3.23/24, Song.4.12), with no hiphil attestation at all. Corrected hiphil to \"cause to be shod (with sandals)\"."
